[01:15.65]correlate 例 Results in the natural sciences seldom correlate with those in history or art. 自然科学 的成果很少与历史或艺术的成果有相互关系。
[01:27.28]irritable 例 Be careful. The manager is rather irritable today. 小心点。经理今天特别易怒。
