[01:45.05]confront 例 We need to be proactive and confront challenges in our career. 我们应该积极地面对职 场中的挑战。
[01:54.39]blackout 例 The large-scale blackout in the community in July caused serious dissatisfaction among the residents. 七月份小区大规模停电引起了居民 的强烈不满。
[02:09.24]grid 例 They have to balance the amount of generation and consumption, or they risk the grid's stability. 他们必须平衡发电量和耗电量， 否则电网在稳定性方面就存在风险。
[02:22.57]cluster 例 Unless otherwise stated, you must run the tasks on each and every node of the cluster. 除非特别声明，否则你必须在集群中的每一个节 点上运行这项任务。
[02:34.66]misconception 例 As a green hand, he always comes up with misconceptions during work. 作为一个新手，他 在工作中经常出现一些错误的想法。
[02:45.54]declaration 例 The declaration does not include a clear promise that Western Europe will contribute more to defense costs. 该声明不包括西欧将承 担更多防务费用的明确承诺。
[03:01.31]smack 例 The book fell smack on the centre of the carpet. 那本书恰好掉在地毯中央。
[03:08.20]denominator 例 The common denominator in all of these strikes is a demand for higher pay to help workers deal with the inflation. 所有这些罢工的 共同特征是要求涨工资，以帮助工人应对通货膨 胀。
[03:24.43]lodge 例 To solve the problem, the best way is to lodge a claim against the insurance company. 要解决这个问题，最好的方法是对保险公司提出 索赔。
[03:36.07]billboard 例 There's a huge billboard in the city's prettiest square. 市区最漂亮的广场上有一个巨 大的广告牌。
[03:44.95]stagnate 例 The industry is likely to stagnate if we do not invest a sum of money for technical innovation. 如果我们不投资一笔钱进行技术革新 的话，该产业可能就会停滞。
[03:58.28]viable 例 The scheme is not viable in practice. 该方案 在实际应用中不可行。
