[05:52.36]conciliation 例 We prefer to resolve disputes by amicable, nonbinding conciliation between two parties. 我方更倾向于双方通过友好、非约束力的调解来 解决争议。
[06:05.99]symptom 例 China's shadow banking can be seen more as a symptom than a cause of some emerging systemic risks to the banking sector. 与其说中 国的影子银行造成了银行业正在形成的系统性风 险，还不如说是它体现了该风险。
[06:22.38]design 例 The plant is allowed to design and build a resource recovery plant. 该工厂获许设计并建造 一个资源回收车间。
[06:32.03]candidate 例 Their concern is whether a candidate can stay calm and positive in the face of difficulties and flnd solutions. 他们所关心的是 求职者能否在困难面前保持冷静、积极的心态并 找到解决问题的办法。
[06:47.80]boycott 例 If you get angry about it, then boycott the companies that produce and market the products. 如果你对此很愤怒，那么请联合抵制生 产和销售这些产品的公司。
